[I] A library for manipulating fonts, written in Python

[T] fontTools is a library for manipulating fonts, written in Python.
[T] The project includes the TTX tool, that can convert TrueType and OpenType
[T] fonts to and from an XML text format, which is also called TTX.
[T] It supports TrueType, OpenType, AFM and to an extent Type 1
[T] and some Mac-specific formats.

[U] https://pypi.org/project/fonttools/

